{"id":"d754a1c4c76d6038","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-recursive-program-scheme.md","title":"递归程序方案","display":"df-recursive-program-scheme — 递归程序方案","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-recursive-program-scheme","aliases":["56-df-recursive-program-scheme"],"display":"df-recursive-program-scheme — 递归程序方案","depends_on":["[[56-df-constructor-trs]]"],"source_reference":"Terese (2003), Definition 3.4.7, printed p77","source_ocr_block":"98","source_status":"statement-compared-to-local-djvu-ocr"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-recursive-program-scheme"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-recursive-program-scheme</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-recursive-program-scheme — 递归程序方案"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"64be5bb144292d4e\" href=\"?note=64be5bb144292d4e\" title=\"56-df-constructor-trs\">56-df-constructor-trs</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Terese (2003), Definition 3.4.7, printed p77"},{"key":"source_ocr_block","html":"98"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-to-local-djvu-ocr"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设有限签名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})\">\\(\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F=D\\mathbin{\\dot\\cup}C\">\\(F=D\\mathbin{\\dot\\cup}C\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 是变量集。每条规则中的变量列表由下式存在量化，不是谓词外的隐藏参数。不同规则的变量可先分离改名。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho_1\">\\(\\rho_1\\)</span> 为规则项对的第一分量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RPS}(\\Sigma,V,R,D,C)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{ConstructorTRS}(\\Sigma,V,R,D,C)\\land\\Bigl(\\forall f\\in D\\;\\exists!\\rho\\in R\\;(\\mathrm{root}(\\rho_1)=f)\\Bigr)\\land\\forall(l,r)\\in R\\;\\exists f\\in D\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists(x_1,\\ldots,x_n)\\in V^n\\;(n=\\mathrm{ar}(f)\\land l=f(x_1,\\ldots,x_n)\\land\\forall i,j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\;(i\\ne j\\Longrightarrow x_i\\ne x_j)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{RPS}(\\Sigma,V,R,D,C)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{ConstructorTRS}(\\Sigma,V,R,D,C)\\land\\Bigl(\\forall f\\in D\\;\\exists!\\rho\\in R\\;(\\mathrm{root}(\\rho_1)=f)\\Bigr)\\land\\forall(l,r)\\in R\\;\\exists f\\in D\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists(x_1,\\ldots,x_n)\\in V^n\\;(n=\\mathrm{ar}(f)\\land l=f(x_1,\\ldots,x_n)\\land\\forall i,j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\;(i\\ne j\\Longrightarrow x_i\\ne x_j)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition 3.4.7（印刷 p77，OCR 页块98）。每个未知函数恰有一条规则，左侧参数为互异变量；右部合法性由 TRS 的变量条件保证。已知函数没有定义规则。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-constructor-trs","status":"resolved","id":"64be5bb144292d4e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-constructor-trs]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})","display":false},{"tex":"F=D\\mathbin{\\dot\\cup}C","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RPS}(\\Sigma,V,R,D,C)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{ConstructorTRS}(\\Sigma,V,R,D,C)\\land\\Bigl(\\forall f\\in D\\;\\exists!\\rho\\in R\\;(\\mathrm{root}(\\rho_1)=f)\\Bigr)\\land\\forall(l,r)\\in R\\;\\exists f\\in D\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists(x_1,\\ldots,x_n)\\in V^n\\;(n=\\mathrm{ar}(f)\\land l=f(x_1,\\ldots,x_n)\\land\\forall i,j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\;(i\\ne j\\Longrightarrow x_i\\ne x_j)).","display":true}],"bytes":1399,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-264","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-recursive-program-scheme.md]]"},{"id":"ecff451f7a97dd8d","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["64be5bb144292d4e"]}